java.question:
This code counts **clumps**: contiguous runs of length ≥ 2 of equal values. What is `clumps` for the array shown?

```java
int[] a = {1, 1, 1, 2, 2, 3, 3, 3};
int clumps = 0;
int i = 0;
while (i < a.length) {
    int j = i;
    while (j < a.length && a[j] == a[i]) {
        j++;
    }
    if (j - i >= 2) {
        clumps++;
    }
    i = j;
}
```

